1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:05,460
So someone under a post said, you know, you can educate people without being rude.

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,220
And I thought about it.

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,100
No, I can't.

4
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:19,960
Sometimes I'm absolutely going to be rude because I feel offended by the arrogant ignorance that be coming my way.

5
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:31,440
So me being rude, you're just going to have to deal with it in exchange for me to continue to actually take my time out to educate folks who choose willful ignorance.

6
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,520
Call it a character flaw.

7
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:37,550
I'll be that.

8
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:41,110
You damn rude, eh?

